Source: https://github.com/DFRobot/DFRobot_BloodOxygen_S

Modifications (marked with BEGIN/END Mind+ local modification comments):
1. ENABLE_DBG is disabled so that the driver does not print debug output on
   the serial port.
2. The UART classes (DFRobot_BloodOxygen_S_SoftWareUart and
   DFRobot_BloodOxygen_S_HardWareUart) and their implementations have been
   removed, since this extension only supports I2C.
3. The DFRobot_RTU library dependency has been removed accordingly, together
   with the SoftwareSerial/HardwareSerial includes and the unused UART macros.

